          "width": 237,
          "height": 148,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nSafety\nCrew safety is not Launch\nEscape System only. The Range\nSafety Officer sits outside\nMission Control.",
        "style": "requirement"
      },
      {
        "id": "land",
        "model_ref": "land",
        "symbol": "requirement",
        "layout": {
          "x": 345,
          "y": 72,
          "width": 202,
          "height": 148,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nLand\nTwo crew land. The flown\nlanding program is P66.\nPrimary Guidance lands;\nAbort Guidance does not.",
        "style": "requirement"
      },
      {
        "id": "talk",
        "model_ref": "talk",
        "symbol": "requirement",
        "layout": {
          "x": 583,
          "y": 72,
          "width": 230,
          "height": 148,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nTalk\nMission Control talks to the\nstack on Unified S-Band.",
        "style": "requirement"
      },
      {
        "id": "abort",
        "model_ref": "abort",
        "symbol": "requirement",
        "layout": {
          "x": 72,
          "y": 276,
          "width": 251,
          "height": 148,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nAbort\nAbort Guidance is not a landing\ncomputer. Pad and Mode I sit\nwith the escape tower; later\nmodes do not.",
        "style": "requirement"
      },
      {
        "id": "air",
        "model_ref": "air",
        "symbol": "requirement",
        "layout": {
          "x": 359,
          "y": 276,
          "width": 244,
          "height": 148,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nAir\nLife support is oxygen, water,\nand lithium hydroxide. Lunar\nModule descent oxygen is a\nteaching figure, not a\nrequired pressure.",
        "style": "requirement"
      },
      {
        "id": "guide",
        "model_ref": "guide",
        "symbol": "requirement",
        "layout": {
          "x": 639,
          "y": 276,
          "width": 258,
          "height": 148,
          "z": 10
        },
        "label": "\u00abrequirement\u00bb\nGuide\nTwo Block II guidance computers.\nPrimary Guidance, Navigation,\nand Control is not Abort\nGuidance. Landing radar is on\ndescent; rendezvous radar is\non ascent.",
        "style": "requirement"
      }
